1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire
Knight of the Ribbon

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Knight of the Ribbon,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Fiftieth Episode
The Fortune Teller
Black Knight of Babel Castle

15
00:02:08,189 --> 00:02:09,000
What is that?

16
00:02:09,280 --> 00:02:10,280
What is it?

17
00:02:18,786 --> 00:02:19,860
I've never seen this place before...

18
00:02:19,884 --> 00:02:21,600
Wait, when did the lights go out?

19
00:02:22,817 --> 00:02:23,926
What on earth is happening?

20
00:02:49,110 --> 00:02:49,953
Forgive me.

21
00:02:51,057 --> 00:02:52,633
I've identified that tower.

22
00:02:52,657 --> 00:02:56,080
It's a massive castle the X-Union is building within Goldland territory.

23
00:02:56,945 --> 00:02:58,873
What? X-Union?

24
00:02:59,630 --> 00:03:01,340
X-Union, you say...

25
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:07,933
I see.

26
00:03:08,397 --> 00:03:10,220
X intends to use that castle as a foothold

27
00:03:10,244 --> 00:03:12,060
to invade Silverland.

28
00:03:12,225 --> 00:03:13,820
They're planning to attack us out of nowhere.

29
00:03:15,620 --> 00:03:17,740
Is the castle finished already?

30
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:18,960
No.

31
00:03:18,984 --> 00:03:22,360
Even for X, it's a massive undertaking, so progress seems slow.

32
00:03:23,720 --> 00:03:25,387
Whether that castle is built first

33
00:03:25,411 --> 00:03:27,613
or we fortify our defenses first—

34
00:03:27,637 --> 00:03:30,040
the very fate of Silverland rests on this race.

35
00:03:55,090 --> 00:03:58,562
Curse the X-Union! I'll never surrender Silverland to them!

36
00:04:18,320 --> 00:04:20,779
Look at those fools in Silverland, panicking.

37
00:04:22,930 --> 00:04:26,503
Struggle all you want, but once this castle is finished, you're done for.

38
00:04:26,881 --> 00:04:28,020
When will construction be completed?

39
00:04:28,650 --> 00:04:30,063
Well, um...

40
00:04:31,147 --> 00:04:32,826
As you can see, we are hurrying, but...

41
00:04:45,875 --> 00:04:46,875
Do it right!

42
00:04:47,310 --> 00:04:49,360
I asked when it will end!

43
00:04:50,206 --> 00:04:51,390
My apologies.

44
00:04:51,714 --> 00:04:55,182
We're falling behind because we don't have enough slaves...

45
00:04:55,207 --> 00:04:56,590
Short-handed?

46
00:04:57,087 --> 00:04:58,446
Then get more slaves!

47
00:04:58,860 --> 00:05:01,900
But we've already used all the slaves from Goldland.

48
00:05:02,881 --> 00:05:04,926
Who said anything about Goldland?

49
00:05:10,060 --> 00:05:12,820
I can see them! Those Silverland fools!

50
00:05:13,355 --> 00:05:17,200
We'll kidnap them and build a stronghold to destroy Silverland.

51
00:05:19,320 --> 00:05:21,440
That's how X operates.

52
00:05:24,110 --> 00:05:25,460
Go, to Silverland!

53
00:05:49,020 --> 00:05:50,600
What is this black fog?

54
00:06:10,820 --> 00:06:12,620
What? Someone else was taken?

55
00:06:13,220 --> 00:06:18,020
Yes. A total of 49 people have been swallowed by that mysterious fog.

56
00:06:19,575 --> 00:06:21,439
Do we still not know what the fog really is?

57
00:06:22,055 --> 00:06:26,520
Well, rumor has it that inside the fog lurks a phantom giant in iron armor...

58
00:06:27,190 --> 00:06:28,190
A phantom giant?

59
00:06:33,953 --> 00:06:37,273
They say the Phantom Giant is a demon messenger from X's Babel outpost.

60
00:06:38,260 --> 00:06:40,383
The fog attacks Silverland at night,

61
00:06:40,407 --> 00:06:43,800
and they say everyone in this town will be devoured by demons.

62
00:06:48,919 --> 00:06:50,400
That's ridiculous!

63
00:06:50,835 --> 00:06:54,540
No, it's true! I heard it from a guy who was chased by the fog.

64
00:06:54,920 --> 00:07:00,260
They say a giant in black armor rides across the sky on an ink-black horse.

65
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:11,000
Who's there?

66
00:07:14,753 --> 00:07:18,437
Allow me to read your fortunes. Let me read them for you!

67
00:07:18,462 --> 00:07:22,946
Hey, I don't believe in fortune-telling. Get lost!

68
00:07:24,180 --> 00:07:31,580
Take heed. A mark of ill omen shadows your faces.

69
00:07:31,885 --> 00:07:37,020
Before long, you shall see a mist darker than night.

70
00:07:37,385 --> 00:07:38,740
That's enough! Shut up!

71
00:07:44,810 --> 00:07:51,660
Don't panic. Cry or scream all you want, my fortunes have never failed.

72
00:07:58,120 --> 00:08:00,253
I don't wanna see any dark mist!

73
00:08:06,880 --> 00:08:08,457
Tink, are you going home already?

74
00:08:08,481 --> 00:08:11,400
What if the Phantom Giant really appears?

75
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:13,060
What are you going to do, Sapphire?

76
00:08:14,650 --> 00:08:17,780
I'll fight. That's why I'm out here on patrol.

77
00:08:18,350 --> 00:08:19,840
Then I'm fighting too!

78
00:08:20,900 --> 00:08:23,800
No way! A kid like you needs to go straight home!

79
00:08:24,076 --> 00:08:26,820
That's ridiculous! You're a kid too, Sapphire!

80
00:08:27,705 --> 00:08:29,740
There's something black under the bridge right now!

81
00:08:29,800 --> 00:08:32,380
Huh? Where? Alright, I'll go check!

82
00:08:35,340 --> 00:08:36,520
Away!

83
00:08:36,740 --> 00:08:39,980
Hey! You fraud! Wait for me!

84
00:08:42,899 --> 00:08:44,683
You meanie! Liar!

85
00:08:44,707 --> 00:08:46,713
Why couldn't you take me along?!

86
00:09:05,919 --> 00:09:07,180
I'm scared!

87
00:09:31,141 --> 00:09:35,207
W-W-What are you?! I-I'm not scared of you!

88
00:09:42,147 --> 00:09:44,621
Help me!

89
00:09:48,159 --> 00:09:49,180
I'm scared!

90
00:09:49,345 --> 00:09:50,280
Ghost!

91
00:09:50,360 --> 00:09:52,140
What is with that kid?

92
00:09:52,160 --> 00:09:53,160
What a weird kid!

93
00:10:17,040 --> 00:10:20,180
That's the cat that was with the fortune teller earlier.

94
00:10:20,280 --> 00:10:21,000
Get lost!

95
00:10:21,001 --> 00:10:22,001
Shoo!

96
00:10:25,723 --> 00:10:28,713
I'm scared, you guys! The fortune came true!

97
00:10:28,985 --> 00:10:30,765
Help me!

98
00:10:39,645 --> 00:10:41,960
I hear something! That's my daughter's voice!

99
00:10:42,400 --> 00:10:44,206
What is it? What is it? What is it?

100
00:10:58,121 --> 00:10:58,842
What is it?!

101
00:10:58,867 --> 00:11:01,073
It's the Phantom Giant!

102
00:11:09,281 --> 00:11:10,013
What's that?

103
00:11:14,319 --> 00:11:16,100
There you are, giant knight!

104
00:11:17,989 --> 00:11:19,180
So this is the black mist?

105
00:11:20,209 --> 00:11:22,220
Where are you, Phantom Giant?

106
00:11:23,234 --> 00:11:25,626
Show yourself, Phantom Giant!

107
00:11:26,089 --> 00:11:28,060
You wait here, okay?

108
00:11:30,250 --> 00:11:32,586
Show yourself, Phantom Giant!

109
00:11:33,095 --> 00:11:34,660
Sapphire will take you on!

110
00:11:43,680 --> 00:11:44,680
Explain yourself!

111
00:11:47,159 --> 00:11:49,700
Why are you kidnapping the men of Silverland?

112
00:12:06,159 --> 00:12:08,480
Damn, it's poison mist!

113
00:12:10,379 --> 00:12:11,379
A magic giant...!

114
00:12:15,334 --> 00:12:16,979
It hurts...I can't breathe.

115
00:12:25,219 --> 00:12:25,920
Opal!

116
00:12:56,771 --> 00:12:59,817
Sapphire, oh, please wake up!

117
00:12:59,849 --> 00:13:01,489
If Opal hadn't brought her back,

118
00:13:01,513 --> 00:13:04,231
Sapphire would be in the hands of the X-Gang right now...

119
00:13:04,809 --> 00:13:07,780
You must be so worried, but what did the doctor say?

120
00:13:07,781 --> 00:13:11,574
He said it's a poison never seen in this kingdom, so there is no known cure...

121
00:13:12,659 --> 00:13:15,936
Sapphire, if only I could take your place...

122
00:13:16,360 --> 00:13:18,780
Sapphire, please wake up...

123
00:13:19,365 --> 00:13:24,320
Your Majesty, I brought a fortune teller hoping he might be of some help.

124
00:13:24,889 --> 00:13:27,817
Now then, Princess Sapphire's fate...

125
00:13:27,841 --> 00:13:30,940
Can that fortune-telling really tell us what lies ahead for Sapphire?

126
00:13:31,445 --> 00:13:32,445
Of course.

127
00:13:32,689 --> 00:13:33,536
Now, everyone.

128
00:13:33,560 --> 00:13:37,760
He is waiting in the hall, so please come hear his prophecy.

129
00:13:44,809 --> 00:13:47,559
Everyone has gathered, I see.

130
00:13:47,583 --> 00:13:49,460
Well then, let us begin.

131
00:13:55,415 --> 00:13:57,780
How dreadful!

132
00:14:05,511 --> 00:14:07,420
Oh, how tragic...

133
00:14:07,730 --> 00:14:10,720
Tomorrow night, this castle will be shrouded in a black mist.

134
00:14:11,120 --> 00:14:16,540
In that fog, you will hear the Phantom Giant approaching.

135
00:14:17,218 --> 00:14:19,231
And so, Sapphire...

136
00:14:19,630 --> 00:14:23,930
will be taken by the Phantom Giant. No one can stop it.

137
00:14:24,050 --> 00:14:26,900
If you resist, you will meet your doom.

138
00:14:27,095 --> 00:14:28,590
Oh, how terrible...

139
00:14:28,614 --> 00:14:30,692
My Queen, what is the matter?!

140
00:14:30,716 --> 00:14:34,140
Everyone! Do not block the Phantom Giant's path!

141
00:14:35,160 --> 00:14:37,192
What a tragic fate!

142
00:14:37,638 --> 00:14:40,880
Princess Sapphire falls into evil hands while still asleep!

143
00:14:55,602 --> 00:14:56,602
Sapphire!

144
00:14:57,365 --> 00:15:01,120
Franz, it's a secret that Sapphire moved into this room.

145
00:15:01,305 --> 00:15:01,973
A secret?

146
00:15:01,997 --> 00:15:04,360
So Sapphire's room will stay empty?

147
00:15:05,380 --> 00:15:06,380
Look, over there!

148
00:15:07,405 --> 00:15:10,129
I will stand in for Sapphire.

149
00:15:10,638 --> 00:15:11,764
Your Majesty!

150
00:15:12,203 --> 00:15:14,567
I tried my best to stop her, but she wouldn't listen.

151
00:15:14,591 --> 00:15:16,200
So I called Franz.

152
00:15:17,035 --> 00:15:19,317
You want me to fight the Phantom Giant?

153
00:15:19,919 --> 00:15:20,365
All right!

154
00:15:20,390 --> 00:15:21,262
Actually...

155
00:15:21,287 --> 00:15:24,385
Franz, I want you to go to X's outer castle.

156
00:15:24,940 --> 00:15:28,404
Rumor has it the giant is a demon guarding the fortress.

157
00:15:28,428 --> 00:15:30,880
If we bring down the castle, perhaps the black fog will...

158
00:15:31,225 --> 00:15:32,630
Leave it to me, Your Majesty.

159
00:15:32,889 --> 00:15:36,380
I will surely crush that cursed tower with my own strength.

160
00:15:37,116 --> 00:15:40,209
Sapphire, I would go anywhere to protect you.

161
00:15:40,420 --> 00:15:42,534
Even through the gates of hell from which there is no return.

162
00:15:42,840 --> 00:15:45,012
So stay strong and wait for me, Sapphire.

163
00:15:47,899 --> 00:15:49,340
I am taking my leave now, Your Majesty.

164
00:15:55,180 --> 00:15:56,343
Be careful, Prince Franz.

165
00:16:35,599 --> 00:16:37,100
<i>It's night. Night has come.</i>

166
00:16:54,960 --> 00:16:56,880
The giant has appeared!

167
00:17:03,399 --> 00:17:04,643
That sounded like a scream...

168
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:18,974
The Phantom Giant...

169
00:17:18,998 --> 00:17:20,908
Just as foretold, the giant has come!

170
00:17:38,699 --> 00:17:41,114
No one will get in our way now!

171
00:17:44,699 --> 00:17:48,955
Ah, my lovely crows, carry her carefully!

172
00:17:51,996 --> 00:17:54,660
Sapphire, you're awake.

173
00:17:55,149 --> 00:17:56,149
What on earth happened?

174
00:17:57,724 --> 00:17:59,540
Isn't this Mother's room?

175
00:17:59,899 --> 00:18:02,912
Well, there are complicated circumstances.

176
00:18:03,060 --> 00:18:03,911
What?

177
00:18:06,389 --> 00:18:07,389
Mother!

178
00:18:07,620 --> 00:18:08,620
Mother!

179
00:18:08,940 --> 00:18:10,643
Mother!

180
00:18:11,383 --> 00:18:12,648
Mother!

181
00:18:13,116 --> 00:18:14,172
Mother...

182
00:18:15,709 --> 00:18:19,193
Just as the fortune foretold, a Phantom Giant carried her off.

183
00:18:19,217 --> 00:18:20,662
A phantom giant?

184
00:18:21,499 --> 00:18:22,248
Sapphire,

185
00:18:22,272 --> 00:18:24,300
you're supposed to be in bed!

186
00:18:24,638 --> 00:18:26,321
That's right... as if I could just give up!

187
00:18:26,409 --> 00:18:27,860
You were hit by poison, after all.

188
00:18:27,964 --> 00:18:29,562
Damn you X. How dare you take Mother.

189
00:18:29,619 --> 00:18:31,745
Look at you, you need to stay in bed.

190
00:18:33,699 --> 00:18:36,478
Don't be reckless, Sapphire is sick!

191
00:18:37,194 --> 00:18:38,638
I'm not Sapphire anymore!

192
00:18:38,662 --> 00:18:39,706
I'm the Ribbon Knight!

193
00:18:40,809 --> 00:18:41,621
Let's go, Tink!

194
00:18:44,603 --> 00:18:45,674
<i>Damn you, X... Just you wait!</i>

195
00:18:45,960 --> 00:18:47,300
<i>I will save you, Mother... I promise!</i>

196
00:19:00,619 --> 00:19:01,801
It's just those two, as expected.

197
00:19:13,826 --> 00:19:16,108
It burns! I can't see...!

198
00:19:21,299 --> 00:19:24,750
Lord X, here is what was promised...

199
00:19:25,720 --> 00:19:26,720
Good work.

200
00:19:30,139 --> 00:19:31,521
Well done.

201
00:19:31,748 --> 00:19:33,236
Now I have nothing left to fear.

202
00:19:33,809 --> 00:19:35,132
This is Sapphire.

203
00:19:36,461 --> 00:19:38,600
Isn't this the Queen of Silverland?

204
00:19:39,294 --> 00:19:40,677
Damn it!

205
00:19:40,701 --> 00:19:43,685
She shielded her daughter and took her place!

206
00:19:43,710 --> 00:19:44,970
Curse it!

207
00:19:47,920 --> 00:19:48,846
What's that bell...?

208
00:19:49,279 --> 00:19:50,920
An intruder! Seize them!

209
00:20:03,799 --> 00:20:05,239
It's Prince Franz!

210
00:20:07,499 --> 00:20:09,857
Goldland remnants, drop your swords!

211
00:20:09,881 --> 00:20:12,060
Slaves, back to your cells!

212
00:20:12,424 --> 00:20:15,060
Unless you want the Queen to die!

213
00:20:16,469 --> 00:20:19,140
Prince Franz! Drop your sword!

214
00:20:20,029 --> 00:20:24,440
Or do you not care what happens to the queen of a neighboring kingdom?

215
00:20:25,076 --> 00:20:25,974
Cowards!

216
00:20:26,006 --> 00:20:27,508
Using a hostage!

217
00:20:29,246 --> 00:20:32,260
I'll give you until the count of ten!

218
00:20:32,724 --> 00:20:34,045
One!

219
00:20:38,378 --> 00:20:38,966
That's...

220
00:20:39,881 --> 00:20:40,847
Mother!

221
00:20:42,019 --> 00:20:43,360
Five!

222
00:20:44,279 --> 00:20:45,868
Six!

223
00:20:50,809 --> 00:20:52,661
Seven!

224
00:20:57,066 --> 00:20:58,699
Eight!

225
00:21:03,662 --> 00:21:04,285
Prepare yourself!

226
00:21:04,309 --> 00:21:05,960
Wait, stop!

227
00:21:07,899 --> 00:21:09,156
That's Prince Franz.

228
00:21:11,879 --> 00:21:13,052
That's a good prince.

229
00:21:13,256 --> 00:21:13,966
Now,

230
00:21:13,990 --> 00:21:16,708
to make an example of him, run your sword through his chest.

231
00:21:16,732 --> 00:21:17,660
Prince Franz!

232
00:21:22,980 --> 00:21:23,980
Ribbon Knight!

233
00:21:24,060 --> 00:21:24,623
What?!

234
00:21:25,256 --> 00:21:26,292
You stupid bad guy!

235
00:21:27,004 --> 00:21:28,120
You little pipsqueak!

236
00:21:28,572 --> 00:21:29,338
Tink! Look out!

237
00:21:31,779 --> 00:21:34,000
As if something like that would throw me off!

238
00:21:36,024 --> 00:21:37,271
You slippery little wretch,

239
00:21:37,295 --> 00:21:38,375
die!

240
00:21:45,060 --> 00:21:46,490
Franz take my sword!

241
00:21:46,880 --> 00:21:47,880
Ribbon Knight!

242
00:21:48,080 --> 00:21:49,204
Let's go, X!

243
00:21:49,754 --> 00:21:51,960
We've been interrupted! Fall back for now!

244
00:21:51,984 --> 00:21:53,078
Wait, X!

245
00:21:53,197 --> 00:21:54,763
Curse you, this castle is lost!

246
00:21:54,787 --> 00:21:56,480
I'll make sure to pay you back for this!

247
00:21:56,490 --> 00:21:57,240
Wait!

248
00:21:57,384 --> 00:21:58,466
Impudent prince,

249
00:21:58,693 --> 00:22:01,520
perish along with this castle!

250
00:22:02,669 --> 00:22:03,920
Damn it! He got away!

251
00:22:06,669 --> 00:22:07,977
Franz, are you all right?

252
00:22:08,164 --> 00:22:10,000
X escaped, but I'm fine!

253
00:22:15,160 --> 00:22:16,896
Look out! Franz, run!

254
00:22:16,920 --> 00:22:18,704
The castle is collapsing!

255
00:22:42,670 --> 00:22:46,842
It's collapsing behind us! Move, fast!

256
00:23:26,160 --> 00:23:26,974
Damn X!

257
00:23:26,998 --> 00:23:28,747
Using a phantom giant transformed from crows,

258
00:23:28,771 --> 00:23:31,060
all because he wanted slaves to build his castle!

259
00:23:31,514 --> 00:23:33,840
So that's why he was kidnapping the townspeople!

260
00:23:34,164 --> 00:23:36,318
X's scheme is completely ruined!

261
00:23:36,342 --> 00:23:37,516
Serves him right!

262
00:23:40,079 --> 00:23:41,240
Where is the Ribbon Knight off to?

263
00:23:41,264 --> 00:23:42,985
I'm worried about X getting away!

264
00:23:43,374 --> 00:23:45,466
There's no telling what trick he'll pull next!

265
00:23:45,491 --> 00:23:46,970
Just be careful!

266
00:23:47,594 --> 00:23:48,846
Thank you, Ribbon Knight!

267
00:23:48,870 --> 00:23:49,960
